{"title":"Shamoneyism","synopsis":"Dukun pelet cinta? lihat takdir? nyembuhin orang? muehehe ini lebih dari itu cuy~ ini cerita tentang Dukun Elit yang bergerak di bidang finansial. Pasar saham menjadi medan pertempuran sengit bagi mereka. bukan hanya puluhan atau ratusan ribu yang di pertaruhkan, melainkan Jutaan hingga milliaran Won yang di pertaruhkan. ini adalah kisah pertarungan Cheon Ji Seung, seorang dukun elit yang di kenal dengan julukan King of Instan Death. yang akan mengacak-acak pasar saham, dan membuat para konglomerat bersujud padanya. Judulnya 샤MONEY즘 = ShaMONEYism gabungan dari Shaman + Money + serapan ‘ism’ yang artinya Dukun + Uang karena ceritanya bergelut di bidang saham dan keuangan","alternative_title":"샤MONEY즘","author":"Narack","artist":"YOUNG GI","genres":["Action","Drama","Seinen"],"chapters":[{"id":"595405b6-8100-45fb-9144-e4b44835adf6","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"id":"f1700669-38c3-477a-9e5b-9d147dab8072","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"2c20d4b0-baee-4676-a859-60110d05589a","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"b2d90f87-9b1c-4a45-964a-98037216d54f","number":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"eff6d6f9-34d9-46e5-9926-d5299f72ec92","number":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"id":"dea72915-ea85-4ab3-a5e2-e4854a6af808","number":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"id":"edf68cdd-f690-44ad-bd75-73d432ff5d41","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"97c87866-702b-4dad-8c6c-2ec52e6fca6a","number":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"e8ae6a7f-9c67-4840-b61d-f714c4a4e817","number":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"60542f18-fba9-4364-8212-1a4304e852c6","number":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"id":"1a9cc4dc-29a0-4cef-a38a-d8e4bce